    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: For clades with fossil-calibrated trees, estimate the fraction of past species or lineages with extant descendants and count complete extinction of higher taxa. A small surviving fraction and many wholly extinct clades support the claim.";
